	<PackageId>Krypton.Toolkit</PackageId>
	<Description>Core Krypton WinForms library: themed controls, forms, dialogs, buttons, input controls, palette and renderer infrastructure, and the official Professional, Office, and Sparkle Blue/Orange/Purple builtin themes.</Description>
